{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01526-s00","batch":1526,"shard":0,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":0,"shard_end_exclusive":20,"translated_count":10,"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"uid":"zhcn:0cba892c4a3835046f65be9c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"跨越了诸多历史的，\n那个京都赛场的终点板钥匙圈\n……呵呵，买到好东西了。","source_fingerprint":"4a5c547569516994a70ecc0ca8c7603eaccb75b2347a134c973a489197bb0662","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","10025"],"target_text":"Chiếc móc khóa cột đích của trường đua Kyoto,\nnơi đã chứng kiến biết bao trang lịch sử\n……hehe, mua được món hay thật.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":1,"uid":"zhcn:4fa0ff347f56ad90c920b023","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"被赛场拉面店的老板记住了……\n最近会在点餐前就对我说\n『老样子吧！』……","source_fingerprint":"4cf5ea889435bdff7abdc59be616ea3cbce5da70e18e20620d2b4f00636c54c7","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","10026"],"target_text":"Ông chủ quán ramen ở trường đua đã nhớ mặt tôi rồi……\nDạo gần đây, trước cả khi tôi gọi món ông ấy đã nói\n『Như mọi khi nhé!』……","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":2,"uid":"zhcn:a448f328ffdc39deb3db8c31","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"头发上的缎带是爷爷送的……\n据说是舶来品……\n呵呵，我在出门时都会带着它。","source_fingerprint":"d675e2cc35ecca225426e9fa3ebe3eeddeb2d029db89c6587f0a3c4ea7d46982","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","10027"],"target_text":"Dải ruy băng trên tóc là quà ông tặng tôi……\nNghe nói là hàng nhập từ nước ngoài……\nHehe, mỗi khi ra ngoài tôi đều mang theo nó.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":3,"uid":"zhcn:d4d94f761aeab0bbfe816271","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"简直就是大决战……！","source_fingerprint":"14b455ac7c1f433d78b7fef520d1740f01a46cb587e2360597bed033e1de3b64","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","1003"],"target_text":"Đúng là một trận đại chiến……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":4,"uid":"zhcn:b7ae52890e7b5138bdaa5ebf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"精彩的对决……！","source_fingerprint":"ba8e4d39a84986e47a6b8fa10ed8828b4418647002e2e66f36ff2c5454be72f1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","1004"],"target_text":"Một màn đối đầu tuyệt vời……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":5,"uid":"zhcn:cfbca0a3080ac8a8a7817c32","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"真遗憾……","source_fingerprint":"ea388628d91740324add460da4117a9c14e91958f600421d58676a45c67854c7","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","1005"],"target_text":"Thật đáng tiếc……","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":6,"uid":"zhcn:294b48ba91fb98421a64d134","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"简直就是大决战……！","source_fingerprint":"14b455ac7c1f433d78b7fef520d1740f01a46cb587e2360597bed033e1de3b64","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","1006"],"target_text":"Đúng là một trận đại chiến……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:2e93b352126c645547321168","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"是历代第一呢。","source_fingerprint":"d05d3345c7a217dfeeeeed96c84d34d92df123d5d4492e648eb201b98b17e87f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","1007"],"target_text":"Đứng đầu lịch sử rồi nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:c707373b8f933d4408ac56d5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要把这一战，载入历史…！","source_fingerprint":"298ea7fcca7001f3557c17447854d2700625b1ea179e327daae99a269e56bdc8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1133","1008"],"target_text":"Phải ghi trận chiến này vào lịch sử…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:dd381662fc6cb7df29131c00","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"Cygames","source_fingerprint":"70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["113